1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,000
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,500
Good afternoon. I’d like to enquire about some information
regarding your resort.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,500
What kind of resort would you prefer?

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
I want a hot spring resort and it is better to have
some indoor or outdoor water activities.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,500
OK. Let me check.
How about Tulip Hot Spring Garden Resort?

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Tell me some details, please.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Fine. It is located in the north suburb – near Peak Mountains.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,500
Covering about 66 acres of green land
with a refreshing environment,

9
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:37,800
the resort provides various kinds of facilities for sports,
entertainment, leisure and meetings.

10
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,800
And the best part is its hot spring.

11
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:45,000
Great. Could you give me some introduction
about the hot spring?

12
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:50,800
The millennium precipitation of the Tulip hot spring
was exploited 3,000 metres deep under the ground.

13
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:55,000
It is a sulphur hot spring.
The major ingredient is sulphur.

14
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:00,000
I heard that sulphur when it is sterilized,
it’s harmless to the human body.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Yes. It plays a significant role in softening the skin,
hydrating the skin and beautifying the skin.

16
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:09,500
It can lower blood pressure and reduce blood fat.

17
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
That’s so great. How about its temperature?

18
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:17,500
It’s 65°C. There are some attentions about the hot spring.

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,500
Attentions?

20
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,200
Yes. The hot spring water contains various minerals
which come out.

21
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:29,000
First in black colour, change to clear water afterwards
with a mineral smell.

22
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:33,000
Adjust water temperature to one’s comfort before bathing.

23
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:34,800
OK.

24
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:40,500
And do not bath immediately after drinking
and please take your jewelry off when you are bathing.

25
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,500
Fine. How about water activities?

26
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:48,200
Merry Water World has 56 different water sports for tourists.

27
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:53,200
You can experience four different sauna rooms
and 21 different spa pools.

28
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:58,500
For a change, one can try the standard swimming pool,
tennis courts and the bowling.

29
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,200
Can you tell me the location?

30
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:04,500
Let me show you the map of the resort.

31
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,200
Fine.

32
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:10,200
Now we are standing at the reception of the Main Hall.

33
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,800
It is at the bottom of your map
and immediately to our left is Villa Part.

34
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:19,500
There are deluxe villas and suites
which have their own hot springs.

35
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,200
Fine.

36
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:27,000
The large building with a big glass roof behind the Main Hall
is Merry Water World – the water sports centre.

37
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,000
Yes. I know.

38
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:32,800
On the top left of the map is the Leisure Centre.

39
00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:37,500
There are sauna baths for women, 4D movie theatre,
a kids room, video games room,

40
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:41,200
a VIP room, a tea house and a beauty salon.

41
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:44,500
Great. And where is the tennis court?

42
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:49,800
It is in the Sports Centre which is located
between the leisure centre and the Tulip Garden.

43
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,800
Tulip Garden?

44
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:56,000
Yes. You can appreciate the beautiful tulips in the garden.

45
00:02:56,500 --> 00:03:00,500
Fine. Can you tell me what kinds of sports
are there in the centre?

46
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:06,200
There is a tennis court, badminton, table tennis,
shooting, arrow shooting, and climbing.

47
00:03:06,
